{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. We have a collateral release request in front of us that needs our attention before I can finalize a decision. The borrower is asking us to release $2,500,000 of packaged inventory from the $4,000,000 currently pledged under the working-capital facility, so they can complete a contracted customer sale. The facility is current and we hold the warehouse receipts in our collateral-control process. Before I can approve any release, I need each of you — risk, legal, relationship management, and collateral operations — to provide your written findings so we can get them into the release memorandum and get sign-offs on file before the warehouse acts. Let's hear what each function has found."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "I have an important finding from relationship management. The borrower has confirmed to me that its customer will transfer exactly $1,800,000 to the bank on the release date, and the borrower has authorized that amount to be applied as the required paydown. I recorded this in a client call note this morning, but it has not yet reached collateral management. This is relevant to the release decision because it confirms the paydown amount associated with the $2,500,000 inventory release request."}
```

