{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "I have a finding from collateral operations. I verified with the warehouse this morning that, after the release, the remaining pledged inventory can be physically inspected weekly and a Friday inventory report can be delivered. Our operations team can enforce both of these controls. I should note that this capability is not yet reflected in the standard release checklist, but it is operationally enforceable and I believe it should be documented as part of the release memorandum and collateral file."}
```

